<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy | SchoolSync</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/common.css">
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        * { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
        .gradient-bg { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4F46E5 0%, #7C3AED 60%, #A855F7 100%); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-700">
    <header class="gradient-bg text-white py-10 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium opacity-90 hover:opacity-100">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to home
            </a>
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold mt-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="mt-2 text-white/80 text-sm">Last updated: June 2026</p>
        </div>
    </header>
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-10 space-y-8">
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Introduction</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">SchoolSync ("we", "our", "us") provides a school management platform for administrators, teachers, students, parents, librarians, and drivers. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect information when schools and their users access our services.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-1">
                <li>Account details such as name, email, phone number, and role.</li>
                <li>Academic records including attendance, marks, homework, and timetables.</li>
                <li>Fee and payment information processed through our payment partner, Razorpay.</li>
                <li>Identification documents uploaded during admissions (e.g. birth certificates, Aadhaar).</li>
                <li>Usage data such as login times and device information for security purposes.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. How We Use Information</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Information is used to operate the platform, manage school operations such as attendance and fee tracking, send notifications, process payments, and maintain account security. We do not sell personal information to third parties.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Each school's data is isolated and access-controlled by role. We apply industry-standard security measures, including encrypted authentication tokens and restricted file storage, to protect data from unauthorized access.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Data Sharing</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">We share data only with service providers necessary to operate SchoolSync, such as payment processors, and only to the extent required to provide our services.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">6. Your Rights</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">Users may request access to, correction of, or deletion of their personal data by contacting their school administrator or our support team.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">7. Contact Us</h2>
            <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">For questions about this Privacy Policy, please visit our <a href="/support" class="text-indigo-600 font-medium hover:underline">Support</a> page.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="text-center text-xs text-slate-400 py-8">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> SchoolSync. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>